  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d0ccca1471d34164ba6a48d39b9b87a9, type: 3}
  m_Name: SafePuzzleTidbit
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BoundSpiritRuntime::InformationalTidbitData
  title: 
  body: "In this puzzle there is a second authentication factor connected to unlocking
    the safe in addition to a passcode: the key. \r\nThis is an example of Multi-Factor
    Authentication. If you need two ways to authenticate and unlock a system, it
    increases the security. It is even better if the second authentication method
    is a physical aspect, like the key, because it cannot be bruteforced and guessed!"
